      "text": "Section 3. Membership. (a) The Planning Council shall be appointed by the Mayor and shall consist of not less than 35 and not more than 45 members, exclusive of those non-voting, ex officio members appointed pursuant to subsection (i). The members of the Planning Council and any alternates that are designated to serve as voting participants of the Planning Council pursuant to subsection (g) shall serve at the pleasure of the Mayor. From among the members of the Planning Council, the Mayor shall designate a Chairperson.",
